  <title class="- topic/title ">Intel® Total Storage Encryption Reporting Structure</title> 
  <body class="- topic/body "> 
    <p class="- topic/p "> This section defines the Intel® Total Storage Encryption reporting structures that are published by the BIOS for OS consumption. The nested structures within the TSE reporting structures must be allocated as a contiguous memory block. 
    </p> 
    <p class="- topic/p "> There is only one instance of this TSE Description Table since there is only one TSE feature. 
    </p> 
