  <p class="- topic/p "> There can be N number of instances of this Intel® Total Storage Encryption Capability Reporting Structure. Each instance is associated with a number of TSE Engines. 
  </p> 
  <table id="GUID-4525E467-8D9E-43A6-983A-1F15B3354D8B" class="- topic/table "> 
  <title class="- topic/title "> Intel ® Total Storage Encryption Capability Reporting Structure</title> 
  <tgroup cols="5" class="- topic/tgroup "> 
    <colspec colnum="1" colname="col1" colwidth="1.00*" class="- topic/colspec " /> 
    <colspec colnum="2" colname="col2" colwidth="1.02*" class="- topic/colspec " /> 
