        </entry> 
      </row> 
      <row class="- topic/row "> 
        <entry class="- topic/entry "> Device Scope [] 
        </entry> 
        <entry class="- topic/entry "> ‐ 
        </entry> 
        <entry class="- topic/entry "> 50 
        </entry> 
        <entry class="- topic/entry "> NULL 
        </entry> 
        <entry class="- topic/entry "> The device scope structure contains zero or more device scope entries that identify devices in the specified segment that are covered by the given TSE engine. The device scope structure is defined below 
        </entry> 
      </row> 
    </tbody> 
  </tgroup> 
